OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA rather cloudy start but sunny
OL,6,Fspells soon developing. Most places
OL,7,Fwill be dry but a few showers are
OL,8,Flikely especially across Moray and
OL,9,Fwestern and northern Aberdeenshire.
OL,10,FOccasionally fresh westerly winds
OL,11,Feasing. A little cooler than recent
OL,12,Fdays.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FA few showers continue across
OL,15,Fthe north and west but for most a dry
OL,16,Fnight with long clear spells. With
OL,17,Fmainly light winds a touch of frost is
OL,18,Fpossible.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
